{%- comment -%}
  SICHERLUFT Landingpage-Kit: performantes Video.
  - Shopify-Video: natives <video> ohne Autoplay, preload="none".
  - YouTube/Vimeo: zunächst nur Vorschaubild + Play-Button („Facade“). Der Player (und damit
    Drittanbieter-Requests) lädt erst nach Klick – schneller und datenschutzfreundlicher
    (youtube-nocookie.com / Vimeo mit dnt=1).
  Tracking: sl-lp.js meldet video_play / video_complete (data-sl-video).

  Accepts:
  - video: {Object} Wert eines "video"-Settings (optional)
  - video_url: {Object} Wert eines "video_url"-Settings (optional)
  - poster: {Object} Bild (optional, für YouTube/Vimeo empfohlen)
  - title: {String} Titel für Screenreader
  - video_id: {String} Tracking-ID
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if video != blank -%}
  <div class="sl-lp-video" data-sl-video="{{ video_id | escape }}">
    {{ video | video_tag: image_size: '1280x', controls: true, preload: 'none', playsinline: true, class: 'sl-lp-video__el' }}
  </div>
{%- elsif video_url != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    if video_url.type == 'youtube'
      assign embed_src = 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/' | append: video_url.id | append: '?autoplay=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1'
    else
      assign embed_src = 'https://player.vimeo.com/video/' | append: video_url.id | append: '?autoplay=1&dnt=1'
    endif
  -%}
  <div class="sl-lp-video" data-sl-video="{{ video_id | escape }}">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="sl-lp-video__facade"
      data-sl-video-embed="{{ embed_src | escape }}"
      data-sl-video-title="{{ title | default: 'Video' | escape }}"
      aria-label="Video abspielen: {{ title | default: 'Video' | escape }}"
    >
      {%- if poster != blank -%}
        {%- render 'sl-lp-image', image: poster, widths: '480,720,960,1280', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 900px, 100vw', class: 'sl-lp-video__poster' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="sl-lp-video__play">{%- render 'sl-lp-icon', name: 'play', size: 28 -%}</span>
    </button>
  </div>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="sl-lp-video sl-lp-video--placeholder" data-sl-unverified="missing">
    <span class="sl-lp-video__play">{%- render 'sl-lp-icon', name: 'play', size: 28 -%}</span>
    <p>Hier später: echtes, nachvollziehbares Video. Datei hochladen oder YouTube-/Vimeo-Link einfügen.</p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
